# The loop visits the elements the collection had when it began (§7.4).
#
# Walking by live index is the obvious implementation and it has two failure
# modes a beginner cannot debug: አዋህድ in the body never terminates, and ሰርዝ
# in the body silently skips the next element. The list stays mutable and
# shared — only the iteration is fixed.
# expect: [1፣ 2፣ 10፣ 20]
# expect: [1፣ 2፣ 3]
# expect: []
ዝ = [1፣ 2]
ዝ ለእያንዳንዱ ቁ፦
    አዋህድ(ዝ፣ ቁ * 10)
ጻፍ(ዝ)

ሁ = [1፣ 2፣ 3]
ታይተዋል = []
ሁ ለእያንዳንዱ ቁ፦
    አዋህድ(ታይተዋል፣ ቁ)
    ሰርዝ(ሁ፣ 0)
ጻፍ(ታይተዋል)
ጻፍ(ሁ)
